      "source": [
        "### Stage 3: Incorrect data\n",
        "We check the salary: minimum above maximum, not in USD, or outside 10,000 to 1,000,000 a year. We found 0 with minimum above maximum, 14 not in USD and 439 outside the limits. We blank the bad salary and keep the posting. Negative views or applies are blanked too (there were none). Then we drop the raw salary columns and keep only normalized_salary."
      ]
